t}\n\n.plan-price .monthly {font-size: 1.75rem;font-weight: 700;color: var(--bg-dark);display: block}\n\n.plan-price .annual {font-size: 0.8125rem;color: var(--mint-dark);margin-top: 0.25rem;display: block}\n\n.plan-features {list-style: none;margin-bottom: 2rem}\n\n.plan-features li {padding: 0.75rem 0;font-size: 0.9375rem;color: rgba(42, 30, 20, 0.8);border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(42, 30, 20, 0.08);display: flex;align-items: center;gap: 0.75rem}\n\n.plan-features li::before {content: \"\";width: 8px;height: 8px;background: var(--mint-dark);border-radius: 50%;flex-shrink: 0}\n\n.plan-cta {display: inline-block;background: var(--bg-dark);color: var(--text-light);text-decoration: none;padding: 0.875rem 2rem;border-radius: 999px;font-size: 0.9375rem;font-weight: 500;transition: background 0.2s ease}\n\n.plan-cta:hover {background: var(--mint-dark);color: var(--bg-dark)}\n\n/* Guide Section */\n.guide {background: var(--bg-page)}\n\n.guide-steps {display: flex;flex-direction: column;gap: 2rem;margin-top: 3rem}\n\n.guide-step {background: var(--bg-card);border-radius: 24px;padding: 2rem 2.5rem;box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft);display: flex;gap: 2rem;align-items: flex-start}\n\n.step-number {font-size: 2.5rem;font-weight: 700;color: var(--mint-dark);line-height: 1;min-width: 60px}\n\n.step-content h3 {color: var(--bg-dark);margin-bottom: 0.5rem}\n\n.step-content p {font-size: 0.9375rem}\n\n/* FAQ Section */\n.faq {background: var(--bg-page)}\n\n.faq-list {margin-top: 3rem;display: flex;flex-direction: column;gap: 1rem}\n\n.faq-item {background: var(--bg-card);border-radius: 20px;box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft);overflow: hidden}\n\n.faq-item summary {padding: 1.5rem 2rem;cursor: pointer;font-weight: 600;color: var(--bg-dark);list-style: none;display: flex;justify-content: space-between;align-items: center;font-size: 1.0625rem}\n\n.faq-item summary::-webkit-details-marker {display: none}\n\n.faq-item summary::after {content: \"+\";font-size: 1.5rem;color: var(--mint-dark);transition: transform 0.2s ease;font-weight: 300}\n\n.faq-item[open] summary::after {transform: rotate(45deg)}\n\n.faq-content {padding: 0 2rem 1.5rem;color: rgba(42, 30, 20, 0.75);font-size: 0.9375rem;line-height: 1.7}\n\n/* Footer */\nfooter {background: var(--bg-dark);color: var(--text-muted);padding: 3rem 2rem;text-align: center;font-size: 0.875rem}\n\nfooter a {color: var(--mint);text-decoration: none}\n\n/* Responsive */\n@media (max-width: 768px) {.hero-content {\n        padding: 2rem 1.5rem;}\n\n    .hero h1 {\n        font-size: 3rem;}\n\n    .hero-meta {\n        gap: 1.5rem;}\n\n    section {\n        padding: 4rem 1.5rem;}\n\n    .plans {\n        padding: 4rem 1.5rem;}\n\n    .plan-header {\n        flex-direction: column;}\n\n    .plan-price {\n        text-align: left;}\n\n    .guide-step {\n        flex-direction: column;gap: 1rem;padding: 1.5rem;}\n\n    .faq-item summary {\n        padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;font-size: 1rem;}\n\n    .faq-content {\n        padding: 0 1.5rem 1.25rem;}}\n</style><main>\n\n<section class=\"hero\">\n    <div class=\"hero-content\">\n        <h1>闪灵<span class=\"accent\">云</span></h1>\n        <p class=\"hero-tagline\">高速专线加速。稳定连接全球。为您打通网络边界，畅享无障碍浏览体验。</p>\n        <nav class=\"hero-nav\">\n            <a href=\"#features\">服务特性</a>\n            <a href=\"#plans\">套餐方案</a>\n            <a href=\"#guide\">使用指南</a>\n            <a href=\"#faq\">常见问题</a>\n        </nav>\n        <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n            <div>\n                <strong>99.9%</strong>\n                <span>可用性保障</span>\n            </div>\n            <div>\n                <strong>50+</strong>\n                <span>全球节点</span>\n            </div>\n            <div>\n                <strong>7×24</strong>\n                <span>技术支持</span>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>\n\n<section id=\"features\" class=\"features\">\n    <div class=\"features-header\">\n        <h2>为什么选择闪灵云</h2>\n        <p>专注提供高质量网络加速服务，技术成熟，服务稳定，满足不同场景的连接需求。</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"features-grid\">\n        <article class=\"feature-card\">\n            <h3>专线优化</h3>\n            <p>采用 IPLC 专线技术，降低延迟，提升传输效率，适合游戏、视频等高带宽场景。</p>\n        </article>\n        <article class=\"feature-card\">\n            <h3>多设备支持</h3>\n            <p>一套账号支持多终端同时在线，覆盖 Windows、macOS、iOS、Android 等主流平台。</p>\n        </article>\n        <article class=\"feature-card\">\n            <h3>流媒体解锁</h3>\n            <p>原生 IP 节点支持主流流媒体平台，高清播放不卡顿，内容访问更顺畅。</p>\n        </article>\n        <article class=\"feature-card\">\n            <h3>隐私保护</h3>\n            <p>流量加密传输，不记录用户活动日志，保护您的网络隐私与数据安全。</p>\n        </article>\n        <article class=\"feature-card\">\n            <h3>智能路由</h3>\n            <p>自动选择最优线路，根据网络状况动态调整，确保连接始终处于最佳状态。</p>\n        </article>\n        <article class=\"feature-card\">\n            <h3>简易配置</h3>\n            <p>客户端界面清爽，一键连接，无需复杂设置，新手也能快速上手使用。</p>\n        </article>\n    </div>\n</section>\n\n<section id=\"plans\" class=\"plans\">\n    <div class=\"plans-container\">\n        <div class=\"plans-header\">\n            <h2>选择适合的方案</h2>\n            <p>三种套餐满足不同使用需求，从个人日常到团队协作，灵活选择。</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <article class=\"plan-card\">\n            <div class=\"plan-header\">\n                <div class=\"plan-name\">基础版</div>\n                <div class=\"plan-price\">\n                    <span class=\"monthly\">¥15/月</span>\n                    <span class=\"annual\">按年付仅需 ¥150/年</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <ul class=\"plan-features\">\n                <li>每月 100GB 极速流量</li>\n                <li>支持 3 台设备同时在线</li>\n                <li>解锁基础流媒体</li>\n                <li>普通线路节点池</li>\n            </ul>\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"plan-cta\">选择基础版</a>\n        </article>\n\n        <article class=\"plan-card featured\">\n            <div class=\"plan-header\">\n                <div class=\"plan-name\">旗舰版</div>\n                <div class=\"plan-price\">\n                    <span class=\"monthly\">¥35/月</span>\n                    <span class=\"annual\">按年付仅需 ¥350/年</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <ul class=\"plan-features\">\n                <li>每月 300GB 极速流量</li>\n                <li>支持 5 台设备同时在线</li>\n                <li>全节点原生流媒体解锁</li>\n                <li>IPLC 专线游戏加速优化</li>\n                <li>7×24 优先工单支持</li>\n            </ul>\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"plan-cta\">选择旗舰版</a>\n        </article>\n\n        <article class=\"plan-card\">\n            <div class=\"plan-header\">\n                <div class=\"plan-name\">团队版</div>\n                <div class=\"plan-price\">\n                    <span class=\"monthly\">¥85/月</span>\n                    <span class=\"annual\">按年付仅需 ¥850/年</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <ul class=\"plan-features\">\n                <li>每月 1000GB 极速流量</li>\n                <li>支持 20 台设备同时在线</li>\n                <li>VIP 专属高带宽节点</li>\n                <li>支持企业定制路由</li>\n                <li>专属客户经理服务</li>\n            </ul>\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"plan-cta\">选择团队版</a>\n        </article>\n    </div>\n</section>\n\n<section id=\"guide\" class=\"guide\">\n    <div class=\"features-header\">\n        <h2>三步开始使用</h2>\n        <p>配置简单，操作直观，几分钟即可完成设置并连接。</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"guide-steps\">\n        <article class=\"guide-step\">\n            <div class=\"step-number\">01</div>\n            <div class=\"step-content\">\n                <h3>选择套餐并注册</h3>\n                <p>根据使用需求选择合适的套餐方案，完成账号注册与订阅开通。</p>\n            </div>\n        </article>\n        <article class=\"guide-step\">\n            <div class=\"step-number\">02</div>\n            <div class=\"step-content\">\n                <h3>下载客户端</h3>\n                <p>从官网获取对应平台的客户端程序，安装至您的设备上。</p>\n            </div>\n        </article>\n        <article class=\"guide-step\">\n            <div class=\"step-number\">03</div>\n            <div class=\"step-content\">\n                <h3>登录并连接</h3>\n                <p>输入账号信息登录，选择节点，点击连接即可开始使用。</p>\n            </div>\n        </article>\n    </div>\n</section>\n\n<section id=\"faq\" class=\"faq\">\n    <div class=\"features-header\">\n        <h2>常见问题</h2>\n        <p>以下是用户常遇到的问题，希望对您有所帮助。</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"faq-list\">\n        <details class=\"faq-item\">\n            <summary>闪灵云支持哪些设备平台？</summary>\n            <div class=\"faq-content\">支持 Windows、macOS、iOS、Android 等主流操作系统，同时提供 Linux 命令行版本。一个账号可根据套餐支持的设备数量在多台设备上同时使用。</div>\n        </details>\n        <details class=\"faq-item\">\n            <summary>如何选择合适的套餐？</summary>\n            <div class=\"faq-content\">基础版适合日常浏览和轻度流媒体观看；旗舰版适合高频流媒体用户和游戏玩家，提供专线优化；团队版适合多人协作场景，支持更多设备和高带宽需求。</div>\n        </details>\n        <details class=\"faq-item\">\n            <summary>流量用完后会怎样？</summary>\n            <div class=\"faq-content\">当月流量用完后，连接服务将暂停，可在下月自动恢复。如需继续使用，可升级套餐或购买额外流量包。</div>\n        </details>\n        <details class=\"faq-item\">\n            <summary>是否支持退款？</summary>\n            <div class=\"faq-content\">新用户订阅后 24 小时内，若使用流量不超过 5GB，可申请全额退款。具体退款政策请参考服务条款。</div>\n        </details>\n        <details class=\"faq-item\">\n            <summary>如何获取技术支持？</summary>\n            <div class=\"faq-content\">基础版用户可通过工单系统提交问题，工作时间内响应；旗舰版及团队版用户享有优先工单支持，响应速度更快。</div>\n        </details>\n        <details class=\"faq-item\">\n            <summary>可以更换套餐吗？</summary>\n            <div class=\"faq-content\">支持随时升级套餐，补差价即可生效。降级套餐需在当前周期结束后生效，具体操作可联系客服处理。</div>\n        </details>\n    </div>\n</section>\n\n</main>\n\n<footer>\n    <p>闪灵云 — 高速稳定的网络加速服务</p>\n</footer>",
